---
description: Rules for the React web app
globs: web/src/**/*.{ts,tsx,css}
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow web/CONVENTIONS.md.
- Types from @/api/types; never redeclare response shapes or use any.
- Server access only through a feature's api.ts TanStack Query hooks.
- Build from @/components/ui; Charm tokens live in src/index.css (coral brand, warm stone, light theme only).
- Sentence-case copy; buttons say what they do; aria-label on icon-only buttons; works at 375px; respect prefers-reduced-motion.
- After changing the web app, rebuild public/ with `cd web && npm run build`.
